e="button" tabindex="0" class="hover:bg-sand-50 flex w-full flex-col gap-8 rounded-lg border p-12 border-sand-900"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-medium">p150a</h4><div class="flex items-center gap-8"><div class="text-utility-md font-bold text-teal-600">$1,399</div></div></div><div class="text-body-sm text-sand-600 w-full text-start">Active cooling</div></button><button type="button" tabindex="0" class="border-sand-200 hover:bg-sand-50 flex w-full flex-col gap-8 rounded-lg border p-12"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-medium">p150b</h4><div class="flex items-center gap-8"><div class="text-utility-md font-bold text-teal-600">$1,399</div></div></div><div class="text-body-sm text-sand-600 w-full text-start">Passive cooling</div></button></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><p>The Blackhole® p150a features Tenstorrent’s high performance Blackhole® Tensix Processor, with 120 Tensix Cores and 32 GB of GDDR6, operating at up to 300W in an active-cooled form factor geared for desktop workstations. p150a includes four passive QSFP-DD 800G ports, enabling users to link multiple cards together to pool memory and improve performance (get a QSFP-DD cable here). p150a is supported by Tenstorrent’s fully open source software stack, granting developers full access to the metal.</p></div><div class="text-body-sm w-fit rounded-sm bg-purple-100 px-12 pt-8 pb-7"><p>Buy 2 or more p150 cards and get 50% off one QSFP-DD 800G Cable</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="w-full flex-col gap-16 py-16 md:gap-12"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16"><button class="flex shrink-0 grow cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0"><h3 class="text-body-md translate-y-1 font-medium">Software Capabilities</h3><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" class="size-16 transition-transform duration-250 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none rotate-0 transform"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.2k-hqqb-85-t6.svg#add"></use></svg></button><div class="flex items-center gap-16"></div></div></div><div class="w-full flex-col gap-16 py-16 md:gap-12"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16"><button class="flex shrink-0 grow cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0"><h3 class="text-body-md translate-y-1 font-medium">System Requirements</h3><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" class="size-16 transition-transform duration-250 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none rotate-0 transform"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.2k-hqqb-85-t6.svg#add"></use></svg></button><div class="flex items-center gap-16"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-24"><div class="@container flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-24 lg:flex-row lg:justify-between"><div class="flex w-fit flex-row gap-8"><button tabindex="0" class="shrink-0 items-center gap-8 border font-bold disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-auto disabled:opacity-50 text-utility-md bg-sand-100 hover:bg-sand-200 border-sand-900 text-sand-900 pointer-events-none cursor-default opacity-50 justify-center p-0 rounded-24 h-48 w-48 hidden @md:flex" disabled="" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Decrease quantity"><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" class="h-22 w-22"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.2k-hqqb-85-t6.svg#minus"></use></svg></button><button tabindex="0" class="shrink-0 items-center gap-8 border font-bold disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-auto disabled:opacity-50 text-utility-xs bg-sand-100 hover:bg-sand-200 border-sand-900 text-sand-900 pointer-events-none cursor-default opacity-50 justify-center p-0 rounded-16 h-32 w-32 flex @md:hidden" disabled="" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Decrease quantity"><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentati