div class="text-utility-md font-bold text-teal-600">$200</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><p>This passive 0.5m QSFP-DD cable from FS inc. can be used for connectivity between add-in boards and systems built around Tenstorrent Blackhole® Tensix Processors.</p></div><div class="text-body-sm w-fit rounded-sm bg-purple-100 px-12 pt-8 pb-7"><p>Buy 2 or more p150 cards and get 50% off one QSFP-DD 800G Cable</p></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-24"><div class="@container flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-24 lg:flex-row lg:justify-between"><div class="flex w-fit flex-row gap-8"><button tabindex="0" class="shrink-0 items-center gap-8 border font-bold disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-auto disabled:opacity-50 text-utility-md bg-sand-100 hover:bg-sand-200 border-sand-900 text-sand-900 pointer-events-none cursor-default opacity-50 justify-center p-0 rounded-24 h-48 w-48 hidden @md:flex" disabled="" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Decrease quantity"><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" class="h-22 w-22"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.2k-hqqb-85-t6.svg#minus"></use></svg></button><button tabindex="0" class="shrink-0 items-center gap-8 border font-bold disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-auto disabled:opacity-50 text-utility-xs bg-sand-100 hover:bg-sand-200 border-sand-900 text-sand-900 pointer-events-none cursor-default opacity-50 justify-center p-0 rounded-16 h-32 w-32 flex @md:hidden" disabled="" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Decrease quantity"><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" class="h-18 w-18"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.2k-hqqb-85-t6.svg#minus"></use></svg></button><div class="text-utility-lg text-sand-0 flex aspect-square h-32 min-w-48 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-800 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium @md:h-48">1</div><button tabindex="0" class="shrink-0 cursor-poi