 bg-green-500"></div>In stock and ready to ship.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="p-section"><div class="section-wrapper flex flex-col gap-28 lg:gap-32"><h2 class="text-sand-900 text-heading-3xl">Wormhole</h2><div class="text-sand-600 flex w-full flex-col gap-20 text-balance lg:w-3/5"><p>The Wormhole™ n150 and n300 PCIe boards are flexible, scalable processors built with Tensix Cores™. Each includes a compute unit, network-on-chip, local cache and “baby RISC-V” cores, coalescing in powerful data movement through the chip.</p><p>Wormhole™ offers superior performance for cost compared to traditional GPUs, and broad data precision format support.</p></div></div></section><section class="p-section scroll-mt-64"><div class="section-wrapper flex flex-col gap-28 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-24"><div class="border-sand-200 relative h-full w-full rounded-2xl border bg-linear-to-b from-stone-50 from-10% to-stone-200 to-90% lg:col-span-7 lg:max-h-screen"><div class="absolute left-0 flex h-full w-64 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-16 lg:w-88"><button type="button" class="bg-sand-50 size-40 rounded-sm border lg:size-64 border-sand-600"><img alt="n150d" loading="lazy" width="3200" height="3200" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fjpb4ed5r%2Fproduction%2F11998107ae9b1ffce906b13ac6c244ccc2e48d71-3200x3200.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fjpb4ed5r%2Fproduction%2F11998107ae9b1ffce906b13ac6c244ccc2e48d71-3200x3200.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button><button type="button" class="bg-sand-50 size-40 rounded-sm border border-transparent lg:size-64"><img alt="n150d" loading="lazy" width="3200" height="3200" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fjpb4ed5r%2Fproduction%2F1badd86