iv class="flex w-full flex-col gap-24 lg:flex-row lg:items-stretch"><button type="button" tabindex="0" class="hover:bg-sand-50 flex w-full flex-col gap-8 rounded-lg border p-12 border-sand-900"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-medium">n150d</h4><div class="flex items-center gap-8"><div class="text-utility-md font-bold text-teal-600">$1,099</div></div></div><div class="text-body-sm text-sand-600 w-full text-start">Active (Axial Fan) cooling</div></button><button type="button" tabindex="0" class="border-sand-200 hover:bg-sand-50 flex w-full flex-col gap-8 rounded-lg border p-12"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-medium">n150s</h4><div class="flex items-center gap-8"><div class="text-utility-md font-bold text-teal-600">$999</div></div></div><div class="text-body-sm text-sand-600 w-full text-start">Passive cooling</div></button></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><p>Wormhole™ n150d features Tenstorrent&#x27;s flexible, scalable Wormhole™ Tensix Processor operating at up to 160W, offering superior performance for cost compared to traditional GPUs and broad data precision format support. The processor can network into a multichip mesh for workstations and servers (such as Galaxy) and is supported by two open-source SDKs for either high-level (TT-Forge™) or low-level (TT-Metalium™) development. (Active Cooling Kit included.)</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="w-full flex-col gap-16 py-16 md:gap-12"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16"><button class="flex shrink-0 grow cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-16" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0"><h3 class="text-body-md translate-y-1 font-medium">Software Capabilities</h3><svg aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" class="size-16 transition-transform duration-250 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none rotate-0 transform"><use href="/_next/static/immutable/media/icons.