DR6를 갖춘 Tenstorrent의 고성능 Blackhole™ Tensor 프로세서를 갖추고 있습니다. p100a는 개발자에게 완전한 오픈 소스 소프트웨어 스택을 지원하여 메탈에 대한 완전한 액세스 권한을 부여합니다.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]}],\"callout\":\"\",\"description\":[{\"_key\":\"4ab187385d70\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"asset\":null,\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c9c0b5a4fb19\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Blackhole® p100a features Tenstorrent’s high performance Blackhole® Tensix Processor, with 120 Tensix Cores and 28 GB of GDDR6, operating at up to 300W in an active-cooled form factor geared for desktop workstations. p100a is supported by Tenstorrent’s fully open source software stack, granting developers full access to the metal.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"details\":[{\"header\":\"Software Capabilities\",\"text\":[{\"_key\":\"7d890ae52334\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"808201fb64f7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Learn more about software capabilities in the \"},{\"_key\":\"17b9258ae3b7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"de28d8e4f10b\"],\"text\":\"Developer Hub\"},{\"_key\":\"bd0d28750fc7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or visit the \"},{\"_key\":\"ae30bcb0da69\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"16ef83873ab8\"],\"text\":\"Documentation Site\"},{\"_key\":\"1dbcf6329061\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" for full hardware specifications.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"16ef83873ab8\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":true,\"href\":\"https://docs.tenstorrent.com\"},{\"_key\":\"de28d8e4f10b\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":false,\"href\":\"https://www.tenstorrent.com/developers\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"header\":\"System Requirements\",\"text\":[{\"_key\":\"d2e4b644cffc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3b84292d0c18\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"CPU: \"},{\"_key\":\"0c06d05b4e0c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"x86_64 architecture*\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[]