ent.myshopify.com\"},\"sku\":\"TC-03003/65-00063-2\",\"status\":\"active\",\"title\":\"p150a\",\"variants\":null},\"subtitle\":\"Active cooling\",\"title\":\"Blackhole™ p150a\"},{\"_createdAt\":\"2025-04-01T17:26:40Z\",\"_id\":\"shopifyProductVariant-45638408110234\",\"_rev\":\"DKZJqyvcXEh3wTKaZQDyoL\",\"_system\":{\"base\":{\"id\":\"shopifyProductVariant-45638408110234\",\"rev\":\"DKZJqyvcXEh3wTKaZQ8oEW\"}},\"_type\":\"product\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-07-30T19:57:06Z\",\"bodyI18n\":[{\"_key\":\"9SqAZx1N8m9IspGhLs8Jw6\",\"_type\":\"internationalizedArrayBodyValue\",\"language\":\"en\",\"value\":[{\"_key\":\"e1958a662d7a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"212a45546766\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Blackhole™ p150b features Tenstorrent’s high performance Blackhole™ Tensix Processor, with 120 Tensix Cores and 32 GB of GDDR6, operating at up to 300W in a passive-cooled form factor geared for rack-mounted servers with forced air cooling. p150b includes four passive QSFP-DD 800G ports, enabling users to link multiple cards together to pool memory and improve performance (\"},{\"_key\":\"358a5a0234f6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"ed324d9c3453\"],\"text\":\"get a QSFP-DD cable here\"},{\"_key\":\"fe7b7fee82a7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"). p150b is supported by Tenstorrent’s fully open source software stack, granting developers full access to the metal.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"ed324d9c3453\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"/hardware/blackhole#qsfp-dd-800g-cable\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"_key\":\"9SqAZx1N8m9IspGhLs8JzT\",\"_type\":\"internationalizedArrayBodyValue\",\"language\":\"ja\",\"value\":[{\"_key\":\"7043bca3a262\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8b00465af3c1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Blackhole™ p150bは、Tenstorrentの高性能Blackhole™ Tensixプロセッサーを搭載し、120個のTensixコアと32GBのGDDR6を備え、強制空冷のラックマウントサーバーに適したパッシブ冷却フォームファクターで最大300Wで動作します。p150bには、4つのパッシブQSFP-DD 800Gポートが搭載されており、複数のカードをリンクしてメモリをプールし、パフォーマンスを向上させることができます（QSFP-DDケーブルは別売）。\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"_key\":\"9SqAZx1N8m9IspGhLs8K2q\",\"_type\":\"internationalizedArrayBodyValue\",\"language\":\"ko\",\"value\":[{\"_key\":\"5fd2e8d95693\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1818dc39e11c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Blackhole™ p150b는 강제 공랭식 랙 마운트 서버에 적합한 패시브 쿨링 폼 팩터에서 최대 300W로 작동하는 120개의 텐식스 코어와 32GB의 GDDR6를 갖춘 Tenstorrent의 고성능 Blackhole™ Tensix 프로세서를 탑재하고 있습니다. p150b에는 4개의 패시브 QSFP-DD 800G 포트가 포함되어 있어 사용자가 여러 카드를 함께 연결하여 메모리를 풀링하고 성능을 향상시킬 수 있습니다(QSFP-DD 케이블은 별도 판매). p150b는 Tenstorrent의 완전한 오픈 소스 소프트웨어 스택이 지원되므로 개발자는 금속에 대한 완전한 액세스 권한을 부여할 수 있습니다.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]}],\"callout\":[{\"_key\":\"61257ec75d54\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"asset\":null,\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e9225e165f82\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Buy 2 or more p150 cards and get 50% off one QSFP-DD 800G Cable\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"description\":[{\"_key\":\"1ba28652db06\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"asset\":null,\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"673b298b8934\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Blackhole® p150b features Tenstorrent’s high performance Blackhole® Tensix Processor, with 120 Tensix Cores and 32 GB of GDDR6, operating at up to 300W in a passive-cooled form factor geared for rack-mounted servers with forced air cooling. p150b includes four passive QSFP-DD 800G ports, enabling users to link multiple cards together to pool memory and improve performance (\"},{\"_key\":\"03df8eb5eeea\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"03765c3e825d\"],\"text\":\"get a QSFP-DD cable here\"},{\"_key\":\"298dd62bb781\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"). p150b is supported by Tenstorrent’s fully open source software stack, granting developers full access to the metal.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"03765c3e825d\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"asset\":null,\"href\":\"/hardware/blackhole#qsfp-dd-800g-cable\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"details\":